    ∫ a, ∫ v, |sgA (paperDesignP 12704) c a v - gbar (paperDesignP 12704) c a| ^ (2 * q)
      ∂stdGauss (Fin (12704 - 1)) ∂muI 12704 ≤ residualMomentBudget q ^ (2 * q) := by
